        <p>{isEn ? "The Reining world offers numerous competitive opportunities at the national and international levels, organized by IRHA, FISE, and NRHA." : "Il mondo del Reining offre numerose opportunità competitive a livello nazionale e internazionale, organizzate da IRHA, FISE e NRHA."}</p>

