            <p>{isEn ? "Reserved for riders and horses with early competitive experiences." : "Riservato ai cavalieri e cavalli alle prime esperienze competitive."}</p>
            <p><strong>{isEn ? "Qualifying categories:" : "Categorie qualificanti:"}</strong></p>
            <ul><li>Green Level</li><li>Short Stirrup</li><li>Entry Level Youth Bis</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="g-card">
            <h4>{isEn ? "Italian Championship" : "Campionato Italiano"}</h4>
            <p>{isEn ? "For Intermediate level horses and riders." : "Per cavalieri e cavalli di livello intermedio."}</p>
            <p><strong>{isEn ? "Qualifying categories:" : "Categorie qualificanti:"}</strong></p>
            <ul><li>Prime Time Non Pro / Open</li><li>Rookie Professional</li><li>Green Reiner</li><li>Rookie Level 1 {isEn ? "&" : "e"} 2</li><li>Entry Level Youth</li><li>Ladies</li></ul>
